      = note: run `yuanme docs org/unsupported-construct` for more
error[org/unsupported-construct]: macros aren't in the Org subset
     --> org-mode/org-manual.org:24405:1
      |
24405 | {{{kbd(C-u)}}} causes all TODO entries to be listed before the agenda.
      | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
      |
      = help: write the text the macro would expand to
      = note: run `yuanme docs org/unsupported-construct` for more
